    {
      "source": "Create a <code>BeanFactoryAwareRowMapperFactory</code> instance using the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>,\n<a href=\"../../core/JdbcAggregateOperations.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core\"><code>JdbcAggregateOperations</code></a> and <a href=\"../../core/convert/QueryMappingConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>QueryMappingConfiguration</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>、<a href=\"../../core/JdbcAggregateOperations.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core\"><code>JdbcAggregateOperations</code></a>和<a href=\"../../core/convert/QueryMappingConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>QueryMappingConfiguration</code></a>创建一个<code>BeanFactoryAwareRowMapperFactory</code>实例。",
      "count": 2
