    {
      "source": "This <a href=\"../query/RowMapperFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.repository.query\"><code>RowMapperFactory</code></a> implementation extends the <a href=\"DefaultRowMapperFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.repository.support\"><code>DefaultRowMapperFactory</code></a> by adding the capabilities\nto load <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/core/RowMapper.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>RowMapper</code></a> or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/core/ResultSetExtractor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>ResultSetExtractor</code></a> beans by their names in <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "此 <a href=\"../query/RowMapperFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.repository.query\"><code>RowMapperFactory</code></a> 实现通过添加以下功能扩展了 <a href=\"DefaultRowMapperFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.repository.support\"><code>DefaultRowMapperFactory</code></a>：能够从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/core/RowMapper.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>RowMapper</code></a> 或 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/core/ResultSetExtractor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>ResultSetExtractor</code></a> 中，通过名称加载 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 中的 Bean。",
      "count": 1
    },
